{"seq":96,"slug":"game-procedural-terrain","title":"程序化地形生成","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 程序化地形生成\n\n程序化地形生成是开放世界游戏与沙盒游戏的核心技术支柱：从一枚种子出发，通过噪声函数、侵蚀模拟、生物群落规则，在运行时构造出数千平方公里的山脉、峡谷、河流与平原，而无需美术人员逐点雕刻。《我的世界》的无限地形、《无人深空》的星球生成、《荒野大镖客：救赎2》的西部地貌，背后都是这套算法体系的工程落地。\n\n本 hub 面向已掌握基础图形学（向量运算、纹理采样）和中等 C++/C# 能力的游戏程序员，聚焦**地形生成算法与渲染工程**两条主线。邻近 hub 的边界如下：`44_game-terrain-systems` 偏地形的运行时系统（碰撞查询、Streaming 框架、LOD 调度器的工程实现细节），本 hub 侧重**生成算法与渲染管线的从零搭建**；`93_game-procedural-dungeon` 处理室内离散空间的拓扑生成，与连续高度场是两套完全不同的数学框架；`11_procedural-content-generation` 覆盖更广义的 PCG（L-System、Grammar、WFC），本 hub 专注地形这一垂直领域的完整技术栈。\n\n**第1章《生成基础》** 建立程序化地形的数学基础：Perlin/Simplex 噪声的梯度场原理与频谱特性，分形布朗运动（fBm）将多倍频噪声叠加形成自相似地形的机制，以及高度图的存储格式与坐标系规范。\n\n**第2章《地形技法》** 覆盖从噪声到可信地貌的关键算法：液压侵蚀与热力侵蚀将光滑噪声雕刻为真实地貌，生物群落分布系统用温湿度双轴将地形划分为沙漠/森林/雪原，地形特征生成（山脉走向、河道、悬崖）在全局控制下叠加局部细节。\n\n**第3章《渲染工程》** 解决地形可见性与视觉表现：CDLOD/四叉树 LOD 在保证帧率的同时维持近处细节，权重混合纹理系统根据坡度与高度混合多层材质，植被实例化布置在 GPU 上高效渲染数十万棵树木与草丛。\n\n**第4章《系统工程》** 处理大世界落地的工程挑战：Chunk 流式加载与缝合协议保证无缝地图，地形与物理引擎的碰撞集成（Height Field 的物理表示），以及运行时地形编辑工具的刷子系统与撤销架构。\n\n推荐阅读顺序：第1章数学基础是所有后续章节的前提；第2章技法可按需跳读（侵蚀与生物群落相互独立）；第3章和第4章各自独立，可根据项目阶段优先选读。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"生成基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"noise-functions","title":"噪声函数原理","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals/noise-functions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fbm-heightmap","title":"分形布朗运动与高度图","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals/fbm-heightmap"},{"seq":3,"slug":"heightmap-generation","title":"高度图生成技术","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals/heightmap-generation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"地形技法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"erosion-simulation","title":"侵蚀模拟","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques/erosion-simulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"biome-distribution","title":"生物群落分布","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques/biome-distribution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"terrain-features","title":"地形特征生成","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques/terrain-features"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering","title":"渲染工程","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terrain-lod","title":"地形 LOD 系统","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/terrain-lod"},{"seq":2,"slug":"texture-blending","title":"纹理混合系统","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/texture-blending"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vegetation-placement","title":"植被布置系统","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/vegetation-placement"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"系统工程","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chunk-streaming","title":"分块流式加载","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/engineering/chunk-streaming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"terrain-physics","title":"地形物理与碰撞","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/engineering/terrain-physics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"terrain-editor","title":"地形编辑工具","url":"/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/engineering/terrain-editor"}]}]}